## Round 109 summary

**The task was r108's first queue item: record the attested deck coverings for Titanic, Yamato and Queen Mary 2.** The round turned out to be pure data — no code path changed; the r107 deck relight and r108 roof/tread gate consumed the records exactly as designed.

